# Accepted IaC findings. Each entry needs a justification; review quarterly.

# Public ALB: this is the internet-facing API by design. Fronted by AWS WAF (managed rule
# sets + per-IP rate rule), TLS 1.3 listener only, invalid headers dropped.
AVD-AWS-0053

# App task egress to 0.0.0.0/0 is limited to tcp/443 (payment provider has no fixed IP
# range; AWS APIs via NAT). All other egress is pinned to the DB/Redis security groups
# and the VPC resolver.
AVD-AWS-0104
